t. With all repairs the command exits 0. No real time, randomness, network, credentials or external services are used; async ordering is controlled by awaited promise fakes. Repository vitest/tsc runs were not used as evidence because no dependencies are installed in the workspace; the harness needs none. Temporary mutation-test copies under .prale-eval/ were removed."
